<title>NEW ZEALAND: Countrywide cuts New Zealand fixed rates.</title>
<headline>Countrywide cuts New Zealand fixed rates.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Countrywide Bank said on Friday it had cut its one-year fixed mortgage lending rate to 8.25 percent from 8.5 percent.</p>
<p>The two-year rate was cut to 8.75 percent from 9.2 percent and the three-year rate to 8.75 percent from 9.45.</p>
<p>The new rates are effective from Monday.</p>
<p>The bank held its floating rate at 8.95 percent for new customers. -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
